uOn2jutJw&oe=6A01C4A6"}, {"file_name": "com.oculus.vrshell-20250529-225251.png", "id": "738243568542532", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499624567_738243571875865_5678206044118997276_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PkcraL5CwGcQ7kNvwFnXezc&_nc_oc=AdoPBmmSAnxtKhw4cfg3y3TIH03IyXY1nlSM6cHMHgghZ-1cTC0ElpbLrrcuwnWu5HA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7jxsazT5eWkJusEOXU-LABB33LMp1Mu-5KSun7_p6Dtg&oe=6A01C4C2"}, {"file_name": "com.oculus.vrshell-20250529-225425.png", "id": "4046287728973254", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499354747_4046287732306587_7014708358063117885_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sLUpEHkemKoQ7kNvwHOKEoq&_nc_oc=AdrMz1ZI_TFNfLl7MaPbQlFxLLI5VNEBPkk6BiUJKCbgSjoTG6U5SjNhoFcZEi69m_A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4wE19Pq40x0Ml4gD-GbiJuW1DJykROIg3rUnone7K99g&oe=6A01C1BB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "HVAC Technician", "keywords": ["HVAC", "VR", "Immerselearn", "Training"], "long_description": "HVAC Technician is a virtual reality training simulation designed to teach and reinforce essential HVAC troubleshooting and repair skills. Trainees can practice diagnosing and replacing critical components, including fuses, contactors, breakers, sequencers, high-pressure switches, and thermostats\u2014all in a realistic, immersive environment. This hands-on experience helps build technical confidence and job readiness for HVAC students, apprentices, and professionals preparing for certification or on-the-job performance.", "short_description": "HVAC Technician is a VR training app offering hands-on practice for diagnosing and replacing key HVAC components like fuses, contactors, breakers, sequencers, pressure switches, and thermostats. Build real-world skills in a safe, immersive environment ideal for technicians and students."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_p